WEBVTT

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:13.957
[machinery whirring]

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:15.042
Huh?

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:26.292
A-ha!

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:38.292
Buzz, I have our bearings.
East-north-- [gasps]

00:00:46.542 --> 00:00:48.333
I'm not cleaning that up.

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:54.458
- Why did we...
- Freeze?

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:55.957
[all] Fascinating.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.416
- Must...
- Avoid...

00:00:57.417 --> 00:00:58.332
Humans.

00:00:58.333 --> 00:00:59.582
[all] Affirmative.

00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:02.167
[♪ dramatic music plays]

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:06.874
[music fades]

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:09.083
Bonnie! Time to go to your sleepover.

00:01:10.292 --> 00:01:11.208
Hmm.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:14.375
Um...

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.666
Yo, Bonnie, uh, what are you doing?

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.124
You said you finished packing.

00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:23.291
Well, I did, but it's
my very first sleepover, Dad.

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:25.332
I wanna be extra, extra prepared.

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:26.957
You're gonna be fine, sweetie.

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:29.207
Come on. Go put on your shoes.
We got to go.

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:30.292
Okay, okay.

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:35.957
[clears throat]

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:37.125
Jessie. [gasps]

00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:39.833
[Lilypad] Uh...

00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:41.957
What are you doing?

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:45.499
We are gonna check out
these "friends" for ourselves

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.874
and see if there is a real one
in the bunch.

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:49.832
Okay, pause. It is not
a good look for Bonnie

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:51.832
- to bring toys to a sleepover.
- [scoffs]

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:53.041
- I do. I do. I do.
- Deputy Buzz.

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:55.541
I do! I mean, I've done things.

00:01:55.542 --> 00:01:57.499
Make sure that device
don't take charge of anything

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:58.457
while we're away.

00:01:58.458 --> 00:01:59.624
Yes, Sheriff. I'm on it.

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:01.542
- [Dad] All right, time to go.
- [Bonnie] Okay.

00:02:02.083 --> 00:02:03.624
No, Jessie. Get out of that bag.

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.832
I'm only thinking about
what's best for Bonnie.

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.750
Well, what do you know?
That's exactly what I'm doing.

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:16.375
- [door closes]
- [car rumbling]

00:02:17.042 --> 00:02:18.541
[Dad] Did you pack your toothbrush?

00:02:18.542 --> 00:02:20.125
- [Bonnie] I think so.
- [zipper opens]

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:24.707
Oh, thanks, Dad. You packed
Jessie and Bullseye.

00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:27.416
Uh, did I? Well, you're welcome.

00:02:27.417 --> 00:02:28.707
[Bonnie sighs]

00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:30.708
- And here we are.
- [gasps]

00:02:31.292 --> 00:02:32.458
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:35.250
I wonder if Kara and Heidi are here yet.

00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:38.416
Oh! Over there. Dad,
I see them. Park right there.

00:02:38.417 --> 00:02:40.333
[Dad] Okay, okay. I see them.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.041
Uh, Bonnie. You forgot your bag.

00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:45.249
[panting]

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.624
- Hey, Chelsea.
- Oh, hey, Bonnie.

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.832
- Guys, you remember Bonnie?
- Hi.

00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:51.666
And this is Jessie.

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:54.292
[as Jessie] I ain't afraid
of nothin', partner.

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:58.624
Oh. You still play with toys?

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:01.082
[friends laughing]

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:02.167
[Bonnie gasps]

00:03:02.792 --> 00:03:04.875
Um... Uh...

00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:08.166
Uh, um... uh...

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:09.625
No. Be right back.

00:03:10.792 --> 00:03:12.291
- Here you go, sweetie.
- Dad, take these.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.749
But I thought you wanted your toys?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.958
Dad, just go.

00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:19.541
[♪ ominous music plays]

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:20.625
[gasps]

00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:23.957
Guys,

00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:25.832
- I got my Lilypad.
- Bye!

00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:27.667
- [gasps]
- [Bonnie groans]

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:30.208
No.

00:03:31.417 --> 00:03:32.708
[Bonnie grunts]

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.500
[grunts]

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:43.083
[panting]

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:46.625
[groans]

00:03:47.917 --> 00:03:48.917
[grunts]

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.499
[gasps]

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.417
No, no, no.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.124
No, no, no, this is all wrong.

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:01.582
How is she supposed to make friends

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:03.249
if they ain't even looking at each oth--

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.333
[screams]

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.624
Oh.

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.458
- [gasps]
- [footsteps approaching]

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.082
Oh, no. Somebody lost their toys.

00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:14.999
What's that?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.750
I said somebody lost their toys.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.291
Let's see.

00:04:21.292 --> 00:04:22.374
[gasps]

00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:25.332
They belong to an Emily.

00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:27.707
[driver] Oh, and there's an address.

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:29.832
- That's not too far from here.
- [gasps]

00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:31.542
We can drop them off.

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:42.292
[phone] <i>Turn right onto Ranch Road.</i>

00:04:49.458 --> 00:04:51.082
[phone] <i>You've reached your destination.</i>

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:52.332
[grunting]

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:54.374
I'll just leave them here in the mailbox.

00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:55.291
What's that?

00:04:55.292 --> 00:04:56.832
I'm leaving them in the mailbox.

00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:58.541
- You're leaving me?
- Yes.

00:04:58.542 --> 00:05:00.457
[panting] No, no, no.

00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:01.875
No, no, no.

00:05:03.625 --> 00:05:05.749
No! [panting]

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.666
We cannot be here.

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:11.166
We've gotta get back to Bonnie!

00:05:11.167 --> 00:05:12.582
Come on, Bullseye. [grunts]

00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:14.667
[♪ adventurous music playing]

00:05:15.417 --> 00:05:16.542
[Jessie panting]

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:19.083
[exclaims, grunts]

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:23.833
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:05:26.917 --> 00:05:29.000
- [gasps]
- [grunts]

00:05:30.917 --> 00:05:32.250
[thuds]

00:05:32.917 --> 00:05:34.749
- [snorts]
- [Jessie shouts]

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:35.750
[screams]

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.916
Uh-oh! Uh! Oh!

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:40.624
[chuckling] Whoa!

00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:41.916
Whoo!

00:05:41.917 --> 00:05:44.167
[laughing]

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:46.332
Hi!

00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:49.042
Bullseye! You thinking what I'm thinking?

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:52.041
Yeah! Yeah, I'm gonna speak critter,

00:05:52.042 --> 00:05:54.124
and we'll ride this horse home!

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:55.916
We're coming, Bonnie!

00:05:55.917 --> 00:05:58.457
Yeehaw!

00:05:58.458 --> 00:06:00.457
- [whinnies]
- [Jessie shouts]

00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:03.207
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Wrong way, horsey!

00:06:03.208 --> 00:06:05.207
Wrong way!

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:08.542
- [whinnies]
- Whoa, horsey! Whoa!

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:12.499
No! No, no, no, no!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.250
- Whoa!
- [thudding]

00:06:18.917 --> 00:06:21.250
[Jessie coughing]

00:06:22.208 --> 00:06:23.457
[groans]

00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:25.874
[coughs, groans]

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:27.042
[sighs]

00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:28.624
Bullseye?

00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:30.500
[horse whinnies, snorts]

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:32.332
[Jessie] Oh!

00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:34.333
Thank goodness. Come here. Help me.

00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:36.500
[person] Daffodil?

00:06:38.917 --> 00:06:40.207
Geez, are you all right?

00:06:40.208 --> 00:06:42.208
- [gasps]
- Did something spook you?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.666
Come on, girl. [clicks tongue]

00:06:44.667 --> 00:06:47.125
Come on. Good girl.

00:06:49.708 --> 00:06:50.708
Hmm?

00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:52.208
[gasps]

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.458
Where'd you come from?

00:06:55.667 --> 00:06:57.292
[chuckling] He's perfect.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.417
No. Bullseye.

